{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF4", "text": "I need to share a FinOps finding from this morning's cloud account reconciliation. We already have existing KafkaCloud reserved-capacity credits that cover exactly six production brokers through the service's first year. StreamGrid has no equivalent credit. I should also note that I have not amended the four-broker estimate in the draft architecture document, so the current capacity estimate doesn't yet reflect this cost advantage on the KafkaCloud side."}
